fix-pattern.no-auth-fix:

allowed_callers: [{ tool_name: 'exa_search' }]


allowed_callers: [{
  tool_name: 'exa_search',
  auth_context: {},  // Explicit empty auth
}]

fix-pattern.gcp-identity-fix:

allowed_callers: [{
  tool_name: 'audience_manager_search',
  auth_context: {
    type: 'bearer',
    token: await getGcpIdentityToken(),
  },
}]

patterns-to-follow.pattern:
Every MCP tool in allowed_callers must have an auth_context:
- No auth: { auth_context: {} }
- Bearer: { auth_context: { type: 'bearer', token: 'xxx' } }
- GCP Identity: { auth_context: { type: 'bearer', token: await getGcpIdentityToken() } }
